  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "갑옷새포켓몬 무장조를 아니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC11C637C0C8D3ECCF13BAAC0020BB34C7A5C870B97C0020C544B2C8003F001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무장조의 깃털은 얇고 예리해서 과거에는\n무기로, 현대에는 식칼로 쓰이고 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C7A5C870C7580020AE43D138C7400020C587ACE00020C608B9ACD574C11C0020ACFCAC70C5D0B294000ABB34AE30B85C002C0020D604B300C5D0B2940020C2DDCE7CB85C0020C4F0C774ACE00020C788C5B4002E001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 초일류 셰프에게\n무장조의 깃털을 선물로 주려고.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020CD08C77CB9580020C170D504C5D0AC8C000ABB34C7A5C870C7580020AE43D138C7440020C120BB3CB85C0020C8FCB824ACE0002E001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZA로열 트레이너인 네가\n무장조의 깃털을 좀 찾아 주면 안 될까?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0041B85CC5F40020D2B8B808C774B108C7780020B124AC00000ABB34C7A5C870C7580020AE43D138C7440020C8800020CC3EC5440020C8FCBA740020C5480020B420AE4C003F001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무장조가 있는\n17번 와일드 존에는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n난폭한 포켓몬들이 많거든...!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C7A5C870AC000020C788B294000A00310037BC880020C640C77CB4DC0020C874C5D0B29400100001BE00000AB09CD3EDD55C0020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7740020B9CEAC70B4E0002E002E002E0021001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너는 척 봐도 실력이 있어 보이더라고.\n그럼, 깃털 찾기를 부탁할게!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108B2940020CC990020BD10B3C40020C2E4B825C7740020C788C5B40020BCF4C774B354B77CACE0002E000AADF8B7FC002C0020AE43D1380020CC3EAE30B97C0020BD80D0C1D560AC8C0021001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여기 있는 17번 와일드 존에서\n무장조의 깃털을 찾아 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECAE300020C788B294002000310037BC880020C640C77CB4DC0020C874C5D0C11C000ABB34C7A5C870C7580020AE43D138C7440020CC3EC5440020C918002E001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무장조의 깃털이 떨어져 있다...!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C7A5C870C7580020AE43D138C7740020B5A8C5B4C8380020C788B2E4002E002E002E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아쉽다...!\n무장조의 발톱이었다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C27DB2E4002E002E002E0021000ABB34C7A5C870C7580020BC1CD1B1C774C5C8B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아쉽다...!\n램프라가 무언가를 태우고 남은 재였다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C27DB2E4002E002E002E0021000AB7A8D504B77CAC000020BB34C5B8AC00B97C0020D0DCC6B0ACE00020B0A8C7400020C7ACC600B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아쉽다...!\n클레피의 열쇠 파편이었다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C27DB2E4002E002E002E0021000AD074B808D53CC7580020C5F4C1E00020D30CD3B8C774C5C8B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아쉽다...!\n파르토의 털이었다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C27DB2E4002E002E002E0021000AD30CB974D1A0C7580020D138C774C5C8B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아쉽다...!\n도치마론의 가시 조각이었다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C27DB2E4002E002E002E0021000AB3C4CE58B9C8B860C7580020AC00C2DC0020C870AC01C774C5C8B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아쉽다...!\n화염레오 암컷의 갈기였다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C27DB2E4002E002E002E0021000AD654C5FCB808C6240020C554CEF7C7580020AC08AE30C600B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아쉽다...!\n화염레오 수컷의 갈기였다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C27DB2E4002E002E002E0021000AD654C5FCB808C6240020C218CEF7C7580020AC08AE30C600B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아쉽다...!\n반짝반짝 빛나는 조약돌이었다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C27DB2E4002E002E002E0021000ABC18C9DDBC18C9DD0020BE5BB098B2940020C870C57DB3CCC774C5C8B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아쉽다...!\n반짝반짝 빛나는 구슬이었다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C27DB2E4002E002E002E0021000ABC18C9DDBC18C9DD0020BE5BB098B2940020AD6CC2ACC774C5C8B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아쉽다...!\n반짝반짝 빛나는 금속 조각이었다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C27DB2E4002E002E002E0021000ABC18C9DDBC18C9DD0020BE5BB098B2940020AE08C18D0020C870AC01C774C5C8B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무장조의 깃털을 발견한 것 같은\n예감이 들어서 화염레오를 피하며 뛰어왔어!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이거 굉장한 식칼을 만들 수 있겠는걸!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C7A5C870C7580020AE43D138C7440020BC1CACACD55C0020AC830020AC19C740000AC608AC10C7740020B4E4C5B4C11C0020D654C5FCB808C624B97C0020D53CD558BA700020B6F0C5B4C654C5B4002100100001BE00000AC774AC700020AD49C7A5D55C0020C2DDCE7CC7440020B9CCB4E40020C2180020C788ACA0B294AC780021001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "키잉!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0A4C78900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "왜 하필 이런 때에!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C65C0020D558D5440020C774B7F00020B54CC5D00021001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미안하지만 무장조를 쫓아내 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8C548D558C9C0B9CC0020BB34C7A5C870B97C0020CAD3C544B0B40020C918002E001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "키잉!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0A4C78900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "휴... 어째서 무장조가\n공격하려 한 걸까?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D734002E002E002E0020C5B4C9F8C11C0020BB34C7A5C870AC00000AACF5ACA9D558B8240020D55C0020AC78AE4C003F001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "키잉!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0A4C78900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "빠진 깃털도 너에겐 소중한가 보구나.\n그렇지만 나도 그 깃털이 꼭 필요해!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE60C9C40020AE43D138B3C40020B108C5D0AC900020C18CC911D55CAC000020BCF4AD6CB098002E000AADF8B807C9C0B9CC0020B098B3C40020ADF80020AE43D138C7740020AF2D0020D544C694D5740021001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무장조의 깃털로 만든 식칼을\n써 줬으면 하는 셰프가 있거든.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C7A5C870C7580020AE43D138B85C0020B9CCB4E00020C2DDCE7CC744000AC3680020C92CC73CBA740020D558B2940020C170D504AC000020C788AC70B4E0002E001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그가 맛있는 음식을 많이 만들수록\n미르의 사람과 포켓몬들은 행복해질 거야.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그러니 부탁할게! 깃털을 내게 양보해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC000020B9DBC788B2940020C74CC2DDC7440020B9CEC7740020B9CCB4E4C218B85D000ABBF8B974C7580020C0ACB78CACFC0020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7400020D589BCF5D574C9C80020AC70C57C002E00100001BE00000AADF8B7ECB2C80020BD80D0C1D560AC8C00210020AE43D138C7440020B0B4AC8C0020C591BCF4D5740020C9180021001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "키잉!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0A4C78900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "응? 내가 가져도 된다고?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C751003F0020B0B4AC000020AC00C838B3C40020B41CB2E4ACE0003F001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "키잉!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0A4C78900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고마워!\n네 이야기는 셰프에게도 전해 둘게.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0B9C8C6CC0021000AB1240020C774C57CAE30B2940020C170D504C5D0AC8CB3C40020C804D5740020B458AC8C002E001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지! 셰프가 새로운 식칼로\n요리를 할 수 있게 되면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n궁극 레스토랑에 들러 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C000210020C170D504AC000020C0C8B85CC6B40020C2DDCE7CB85C000AC694B9ACB97C0020D5600020C2180020C788AC8C0020B418BA7400100001BE00000AAD81ADF90020B808C2A4D1A0B791C5D00020B4E4B7EC0020C9180021001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "키잉!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0A4C78900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 마음이 무장조에게 잘 전달됐을까?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020B9C8C74CC7740020BB34C7A5C870C5D0AC8C0020C7980020C804B2ECB410C744AE4C003F001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "전달됐을 거예요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C804B2ECB410C7440020AC70C608C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다음에 가게에 들를게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C74CC5D00020AC00AC8CC5D00020B4E4B97CAC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "야생 포켓몬과 이렇게나 가까워질 줄이야,\n앞으로가 기대되는걸.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACACFC0020C774B807AC8CB0980020AC00AE4CC6CCC9C80020C904C774C57C002C000AC55EC73CB85CAC000020AE30B300B418B294AC78002E001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
